    <item>
      <title>看病先签“AI卖身契”？墨尔本心理医生：不用AI记笔记？那您换一家吧</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/aiai-20260518231003785-2/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 23:10:03 +0800</pubDate>
